<title>SPAIN: Uralita to propose 3 pct capital cut-CNMV.</title>
<headline>Uralita to propose 3 pct capital cut-CNMV.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Uralita will propose cutting its capital by three percent through a cancellation of Treasury stock at its shareholders meeting on Friday, according to a mandatory disclosure to the CNMV.</p>
<p>In addition, the company plans to reduce its nominal share value by 40 pesetas, which will be paid out to shareholders if the disinvestment proceeds as forecast, the mandatory disclosure said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
